            proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        }
    }
}
```
You can also use a third party library like `ngx-proxy` which is a simple reverse proxy for Angular applications.

It's important to note that you will also need to configure your Angular application to use the proxy server. You can do this by adding a `proxy` configuration to your `angular.json` file.
