                swapped = true;
            }
        }
        n -= 1; // Decrement n because the nth element is now in the right place
    }
}
```

This implementation of bubble sort optimizes slightly by reducing the range of the inner loop on each pass (as the last elements become sorted) and by stopping early if no swaps occur in a pass.

